  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 41",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "41",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After two years had passed, the king of Egypt dreamt that he was standing by the River Nile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when seven cows, fat and sleek, came up out of the river and began to feed on the grass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then seven other cows came up; they were thin and bony. They came and stood by the other cows on the river bank, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the thin cows ate up the fat cows. Then the king woke up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He fell asleep again and had another dream. Seven ears of corn, full and ripe, were growing on one stalk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then seven other ears of corn sprouted, thin and scorched by the desert wind, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the thin ears of corn swallowed the full ones. The king woke up and realized that he had been dreaming. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the morning he was worried, so he sent for all the magicians and wise men of Egypt. He told them his dreams, but no one could explain them to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the wine steward said to the king, “I must confess today that I have done wrong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You were angry with the chief baker and me, and you put us in prison in the house of the captain of the guard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One night each of us had a dream, and the dreams had different meanings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A young Hebrew was there with us, a slave of the captain of the guard. We told him our dreams, and he interpreted them for us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Things turned out just as he said: you restored me to my position, but you executed the baker.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king sent for Joseph, and he was immediately brought from the prison. After he had shaved and changed his clothes, he came into the king's presence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said to him, “I have had a dream, and no one can explain it. I have been told that you can interpret dreams.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joseph answered, “I cannot, Your Majesty, but God will give a favourable interpretation.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said, “I dreamt that I was standing on the bank of the Nile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when seven cows, fat and sleek, came up out of the river and began feeding on the grass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then seven other cows came up which were thin and bony. They were the poorest cows I have ever seen anywhere in Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thin cows ate up the fat ones, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but no one would have known it, because they looked just as bad as before. Then I woke up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I also dreamt that I saw seven ears of corn which were full and ripe, growing on one stalk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then seven ears of corn sprouted, thin and scorched by the desert wind, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the thin ears of corn swallowed the full ones. I told the dreams to the magicians, but none of them could explain them to me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joseph said to the king, “The two dreams mean the same thing; God has told you what he is going to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seven fat cows are seven years, and the seven full ears of corn are also seven years; they have the same meaning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seven thin cows which came up later and the seven thin ears of corn scorched by the desert wind are seven years of famine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is just as I told you — God has shown you what he is going to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There will be seven years of great plenty in all the land of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After that, there will be seven years of famine, and all the good years will be forgotten, because the famine will ruin the country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The time of plenty will be entirely forgotten, because the famine which follows will be so terrible. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The repetition of your dream means that the matter is fixed by God and that he will make it happen in the near future.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now you should choose some man with wisdom and insight and put him in charge of the country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must also appoint other officials and take a fifth of the crops during the seven years of plenty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Order them to collect all the food during the good years that are coming, and give them authority to store up corn in the cities and guard it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The food will be a reserve supply for the country during the seven years of famine which are going to come on Egypt. In this way the people will not starve.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king and his officials approved this plan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he said to them, “We will never find a better man than Joseph, a man who has God's Spirit in him.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said to Joseph, “God has shown you all this, so it is obvious that you have greater wisdom and insight than anyone else. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will put you in charge of my country, and all my people will obey your orders. Your authority will be second only to mine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I now appoint you governor over all Egypt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king removed from his finger the ring engraved with the royal seal and put it on Joseph's finger. He put a fine linen robe on him, and placed a gold chain round his neck. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He gave him the second royal chariot to ride in, and his guard of honour went ahead of him and cried out, “Make way! Make way!” And so Joseph was appointed governor over all Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king said to him, “I am the king — and no one in all Egypt shall so much as lift a hand or a foot without your permission.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He gave Joseph the Egyptian name Zaphenath Paneah, and he gave him a wife, Asenath, the daughter of Potiphera, a priest in the city of Heliopolis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45+GEN.41.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45",
              "GEN.41.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joseph was thirty years old when he began to serve the king of Egypt. He left the king's court and travelled all over the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45+GEN.41.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45",
              "GEN.41.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "During the seven years of plenty the land produced abundant crops, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all of which Joseph collected and stored in the cities. In each city he stored the food from the fields around it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was so much corn that Joseph stopped measuring it — it was like the sand of the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before the years of famine came, Joseph had two sons by Asenath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “God has made me forget all my sufferings and all my father's family”; so he named his first son Manasseh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.51",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Manasseh",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name sounds like the Hebrew for “cause to forget”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also said, “God has given me children in the land of my trouble”; so he named his second son Ephraim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.52",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ephraim",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name sounds like the Hebrew for “give children”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seven years of plenty that the land of Egypt had enjoyed came to an end, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the seven years of famine began, just as Joseph had said. There was famine in every other country, but there was food throughout Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Egyptians began to be hungry, they cried out to the king for food. So he ordered them to go to Joseph and do what he told them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The famine grew worse and spread over the whole country, so Joseph opened all the storehouses and sold corn to the Egyptians. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "People came to Egypt from all over the world to buy corn from Joseph, because the famine was severe everywhere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GEN.42",
